{"title":"Embalming Resin","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Withered Husk, Mummy, Embalmed Priest</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>What it’s for</h2><p>A <b>gear-line reagent</b>. Each <b>quality reroll</b> of <b>staves</b> uses one.</p><p><b>Dropped by</b> <b>Mummy</b>: <a href=\"#/monster/withered-husk\">Withered Husk</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/mummy\">Mummy</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/embalmed-priest\">Embalmed Priest</a>, about 1 kill in 500 (an elite 1 in 50).</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging &amp; reagents</a> for the odds and fees, and <a href=\"#/guide/reagents\">Reagents</a> for every reagent.</p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"mummy\" title=\"Mummy - dropped it in 35 of 65 looted corpses (1/1.9)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a272b34a0b2a37171a72.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mummy</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.9<br>×1–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"withered-husk\" title=\"Withered Husk - dropped it in 43 of 93 looted corpses (1/2)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/781cfb7a1f975aec8cdf.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Withered Husk</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"embalmed-priest\" title=\"Embalmed Priest - dropped it in 1 of 6 looted corpses (1/6)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/93110eebbbe23ef1adb0.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Embalmed Priest</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/6<br>×2</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"embalming-resin\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/c14fa819b67a6c555eef.svg\" alt=\"Embalming Resin\"></div><h3>Embalming Resin</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>3 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>9/28/2026, 10:13:45 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}